ends to a server.\n             So the room server routes an id it can see and relays bytes it cannot read.\nno accounts  no server-side copy, no cross-device sync. Excalidraw+ is a separate product.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":true}],"appState":{"gridSize":null,"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff"},"files":{}}
